OL,3,ABurnham invites Swinney to work
OL,4,Atogether on 'deeper Scottish
OL,5,Adevolution'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe prime minister has invited the
OL,8,FScottish government to work together to
OL,9,Fput "power back in the hands" of
OL,10,Fregions.
OL,12,FAndy Burnham said he wanted to start
OL,13,Fwork on a new deal for regional
OL,14,Feconomic development in the next few
OL,15,Fmonths, including an offer of
OL,16,Fdevolution from the Department for Work
OL,17,Fand Pensions (DWP).
OL,19,FSpeaking at an event in Motherwell,
OL,20,FBurnham called for further powers to be
OL,21,Fdevolved from Holyrood to local areas
OL,22,Fbefore that happened.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
