OL,3,ABurnham invites Swinney to work
OL,4,Atogether on 'deeper Scottish
OL,5,Adevolution'
OL,6,
OL,7,FSNP minister Stephen Flynn said the
OL,8,Fparty had been calling for increased
OL,9,Fdevolved powers since the Smith
OL,10,FCommission report was published in
OL,11,F2014.
